Meno siete:
    producer_consumer

Komentár:
    Bounded-buffer producer-consumer (buffer capacity = 3).
    No events needed — use Step to advance manually.

    Producer cycle: prod_idle -> T_start_produce -> prod_busy -> T_finish_produce -> prod_idle
    Consumer cycle: cons_idle -> T_start_consume -> cons_busy -> T_finish_consume -> cons_idle
    Shared:         buffer (items), free (empty slots)

    Interesting states to observe:
      - Buffer fills up (free=0): only consumer can run
      - Buffer empty (buffer=0): only producer can run
      - Both running concurrently when buffer has 1-2 items

